  "bio": "<p>Born in the Arizona desert, a veteran of multiple explorations into the Sahara desert via Morocco and Western Sahara, and now a resident of the Mojave, Derek Monypeny sees his musical mission as adding to and expanding on what he calls the \"desert continuum;\" the psychedelic sirocco swirl of desert-based stringed instruments played with utter abandon by musicians the world over.</p>",
  "socials": "<p>instagram.com/derek_monypeny</p>",
